sequenceDiagram
    actor ClientA as Client 1
    actor ClientB as Client 2
    participant Socket as Unix Domain Socket
    participant Server as JingWei Host and Proxy
    participant Display as Display and Layer Manager
    participant Accel as Accelerator and Backend

    Note over ClientA,Server: Header = TYPE(1) | CMD(1) | LEN(2) | ID(2) | CHECKSUM(1) | PAYLOAD(N)

    ClientA-)Socket: connect()
    ClientB-)Socket: connect()
    Socket->>Server: accept client sessions
    ClientA->>Socket: CREATE_LAYER or UPDATE_LAYER
    Socket->>+Server: decode frame and validate length
    Note right of Server: checksum = header bytes + selected payload byte
    Server->>Server: validate_checksum(msg, len)
    alt valid frame
        Server->>Display: mutate display or layer state
        Display->>Accel: compose dirty regions
        Accel-->>Display: render complete
        Display-->>Server: commit framebuffer
        Server-->>Socket: RESPONSE or EVENT or ACK
        Socket-->>ClientA: result with message id
    else invalid frame
        Server-->>Socket: protocol error
        Socket-->>ClientA: checksum or format error
    end
    par broadcast events
        Display-->>Server: vsync or system event
        Server-->>Socket: notify subscribed clients
        Socket-->>ClientA: EVENT frame
        Socket-->>ClientB: EVENT frame
    and concurrent request
        ClientB->>Socket: UPDATE_LAYER or DESTROY_LAYER
        Socket->>Server: dispatch second client request
    end